# experiments/.gitignore -- the campaign trees live here WHOLE (most omni raw artifacts live under
# parkour/logs / parkour/outputs, outside this tree).
# Git tracks only the keep-set: human records (md/json/csv/py/sh), eval summaries (run_meta.json,
# scenario_metrics.json, summary.md, gait_diagram_*.png), reference RSI banks / statics at the
# campaign top level, and the checkpoint(s) of record (head + extra_heads) under <campaign>/head/
# (tools/bundle_experiment.py). Patterns are relative to this directory.

# RSL-RL run dirs (checkpoints, params, tfevents). A DIRECTORY rule: nothing below it can be
# re-included, which is why the head of record is a sha-verified COPY at <campaign>/head/.
# <campaign>/logs/rsl_rl/curriculum_state.json sits one level above and stays tracked.
**/logs/rsl_rl/*/
**/outputs/
**/videos/
# per-episode dumps inside any gait_eval*/ run dir
**/raw/
**/metrics/
# file classes
*.pt
*.log
*.mp4
*.pid
events.out.tfevents.*
__pycache__/
# raw probe arrays below a campaign's top level; reference banks at <campaign>/*.npz stay
*/*/**/*.npz
!*/statics/statics_*.npz
# raw per-source RSI harvests (merge intermediates, ~24 MB each); the merged bank stays tracked
*/rsi_bank_*_raw.npz
# the bundled checkpoint of record (re-inclusion works because head/ itself is not excluded)
!*/head/model_*.pt
# Inherited from the forward task's copy; INERT here (the omni tree has no old-runs/): the forward
# task's May-2026 stage-baseline bundles live under crab_hex_forward_task/experiments/old-runs/.
!old-runs/**/*.pt
